msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX1 pin must be configured to be used as true UART RX pin for"
" use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL1 "
"port’s RX input pin.ref:\\ ``SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`` is "
"alreaddy set by default to “23” to allow RC receiver connection to UART1."
msgstr ""
"为在 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机上使用 CRSF 及内嵌数传，必须将 RX1 引脚配置为真正的 UART RX 引脚以用于双向系统：将"
" :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 “1”，使其成为 SERIAL1 端口的 RX "
"输入引脚。ref:\\ ``SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`` 默认已设为 “23”，以允许 RC 接收机连接到 "
"UART1。"
